{"version":1,"key":"quest:207","content":{"id":207,"title":"beforeinput 事件和 input 事件的关系，作用！","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:207","type":"quest","id":207},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"beforeinput 在输入写入前拦截非法内容","meta":"","excerpt":"在表单中限制用户只能输入数字，一种常见做法是监听 input 事件，检测到非法字符后再把值覆盖回去。但这会产生一个体验问题：非法字符会短暂出现在输入框中再消失。如果能在值写入 DOM 之前就拦截掉非法输入，体验会更干净。beforeinput 事件正是在这个时机触发的，它和 input 事件分别对应输入流程中「修改前」","target":{"key":"card:765","type":"card","id":765},"citeKey":"card:765"}],"trail":[{"time":1781248042798,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1782297395164,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1782350930758,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1781248042798,"updateTime":1781248042798,"resolvedTime":1782350930758},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1781248042798}}